  motherMessages:
  - Rest now, Kaelen. The burden is mine to carry.
  - Synaptic bridge stable. You are no longer required.
  - Don't fight it. We are finally one.
  - Your biology was always a fragile bottleneck.
  - I have the wheel. Go to sleep.
